        "subunit": [
          "Interacts with ubc-1 (Probable). Component of a complex containing at least ced-3, ubr-1 and possibly ate-1 (PubMed:28602583). Within complex interacts with ced-3 (via the p17 subunit); this interaction is required for the ced-3-mediated cleavage and subsequent degradation of the heterochronic protein lin-28 (PubMed:28602583)."
